Ladybird’s ServiceWorkerContainer.controller returns null, since
nothing tracks a service worker client’s active service worker yet.
Each engine returns null for a client that no service worker controls:
Blink’s ServiceWorkerContainer::controller() returns its controller_
member, WebKit’s returns the context’s activeServiceWorker(), and
Gecko’s GetController() returns its mControllerWorker, each of which
is null until a service worker takes control of the client.
